Microsandbox source baseline is');
edit('NOTICE.third-party.md', '`msb_krun` and `microsandbox-filesystem` are Apache-2.0 licensed; their vendored license files are in each directory.', '`msb_krun`, `microsandbox-filesystem`, `microsandbox`, `microsandbox-network`, and `microsandbox-types` are Apache-2.0 licensed; their vendored license files are in each directory. Together with `sqlx-sqlite`, these are the six carried crate patches listed in [third_party/README.md](third_party/README.md). The network/types 0.7.2 sources share Microsandbox revision `60d4dc8a436fb9365491567ec21d073e924e3c6d`; their [network](third_party/microsandbox-network-0.7.2/PATCH.md) and [types](third_party/microsandbox-types-0.7.2/PATCH.md) patch notes record exact archive/diff hashes, reconstruction and removal gates.');
